{"3634930": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "60 Below", "steam_appid": 3634930, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60 Below is a first-person atmospheric survival horror game where you must bring back power to a large underground facility engulfed in an unnatural cold mist, in order to escape its deadly, freezing confines you find yourself trapped in.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Repair and Restore</strong> - Restore power to the facility and bring it back to life. Repair the power grid to widen your margin of error and aid your escape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore </strong>- Explore the frozen remnants of an underground facility and look for anything that can aid you in your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive </strong>- Survive the cold by staying in heated rooms or by supplementing your body using questionable chemicals. Manage your available power and don't let it run out, or your death will be a swift one! </p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60 Below is a first-person atmospheric survival horror game where you must bring back power to a large underground facility engulfed in an unnatural cold mist, in order to escape its deadly, freezing confines you find yourself trapped in.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Repair and Restore</strong> - Restore power to the facility and bring it back to life. Repair the power grid to widen your margin of error and aid your escape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore </strong>- Explore the frozen remnants of an underground facility and look for anything that can aid you in your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive </strong>- Survive the cold by staying in heated rooms or by supplementing your body using questionable chemicals. Manage your available power and don't let it run out, or your death will be a swift one! </p></li></ul>", "short_description": "60 Below is a first-person atmospheric survival horror game where you must bring back power to a large underground facility engulfed in an unnatural cold mist, in order to escape its deadly, freezing confines you find yourself trapped in.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634930/f2736e0570a023aa7fd728135aeca49eee5f6bd0/header.jpg?t=1787829940", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634930/5a9a4e121a021711ba5c18f7871f64d518a88a09/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787829940", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634930/5a9a4e121a021711ba5c18f7871f64d518a88a09/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787829940", "website": "https://totemgamedev.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  AMD Ryzen 3 1200 / Intel Core i5-7500<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon RX 560 with 4GB VRAM / NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 Ti with 4GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Linux 6.19 LTS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  AMD Ryzen 3 1200 / Intel Core i5-7500<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon RX 560 with 4GB VRAM / NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 Ti with 4GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "developers": ["Totem Game Dev"], "publishers": ["Totem Game Dev"], "package_groups": []